            "heading": "48 hours, almost all of it waiting",
            "text": "<p>The glaze takes about 10 minutes on the stove, the broiler takes 5. Everything in between is the refrigerator doing the work. Start it Friday, eat it all week.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
