            "heading": "Serves 4, or four lunches",
            "text": "<p>Four fillets and a cup of sushi rice fills four bento boxes. Scaling up is just more fillets &mdash; the marinade quantity stretches further than you expect.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
