    "marinade_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "know-the-marinade",
        "liquid": "\n<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink:#171717; --muted:#5c5c5c; --line:#e5e2dc; --wash:#faf8f4; --gold:#bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink); background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading { font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 10px; }\n  .sea-pepper__lede { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 22px; }\n  .sea-pepper__rows { display: grid; gap: 14px; }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 10px 16px; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold); }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1; margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff; background: var(--gold); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on { background: #b8462f; border-color: #b8462f; }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure { margin: 0; }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted); }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper { padding: 22px; }\n    .sea-pepper__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n    .sea-pepper__figure { order: -1; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">Know the marinade</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Forty-eight hours is the recipe. Everything shorter is a different dish.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        This is a <em>cure</em> more than a marinade. Miso is salty and full of enzymes, and given\n        two days it draws moisture out of the fillet and pushes flavour in, firming the flesh and\n        leaving sugars at the surface that caramelise the moment they meet the broiler. Rush it and\n        you get salmon with sauce on it &mdash; pleasant, but not the thing Nobu made famous.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n            <span>48 hours</span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">As written</span>\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Depth: 5 out of 5\">\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span><span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span><span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Flavour all the way through, flesh noticeably firmer, and a glaze that lacquers rather than sits on top. Turn the fillets once at the halfway mark.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\"><span>24 hours</span></p>\n          <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Depth: 3 out of 5\">\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span><span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span><span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The honest compromise, and still very good. The outer quarter-inch is seasoned; the centre tastes of salmon. Caramelises almost as well.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\"><span>4 hours or less</span></p>\n          <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Depth: 1 out of 5\">\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span><span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span><span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">A glaze, not a cure. Fine on a weeknight if you brush extra marinade on before broiling, but do not expect the texture change &mdash; that is what the time buys.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Pips are relative depth across the three, not a measurement. Past about 72 hours the salt\n        starts working against you and the texture turns dense, so 48 is a ceiling as well as a target.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img src=\"{{ 'miso-bento-05-salmon-in-marinade.jpg' | file_url }}&amp;width=700\"\n           alt=\"King salmon fillets submerged in cooled miso and sake marinade, ready for two days in the refrigerator\"\n           width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">Fully submerged, covered, and turned once at the halfway mark.</p>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "padding_top": 44,
