            "text": "<p>Scrape off the excess &mdash; what is left will burn before the fish cooks &mdash; then brush a thin fresh layer on top. Under a preheated broiler about 5 minutes, rotating halfway, until the edges go deep golden. Pull it around 130&deg;F.</p>",
