            "heading": "Rest, then build the boxes",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Rest 3&ndash;5 minutes on the sheet; carryover heat takes it the rest of the way. Sushi rice into each box, then broccolini, avocado and pickled onion, salmon on top, and finish with roe and scallions.</p>",
